alright so in the world of chainsaw man  the angel devil is easily one of the  best characters and despite having the  appearance of a 12 year old child he's  also one of the strongest today we're  going to be breaking down exactly what  makes him so interesting and by the end  you'll understand his full backstory the  nature of his abilities and the sad  reason why makama ruined his life before  we get into it though don't forget to  sub to the channel for more chainsaw man  videos like this especially if you're  interested in seeing episode breakdowns  for the anime when it comes out  okay so for anyone watching who might  not know how devils are created in this  series i'm going to do a brief  explanation just that the rest of the  video makes sense to start things off  there are two locations we need to be  aware of the first being hell which is  the dimension where all devils are first  born and the second location being earth  the way things work is that if enough  people on earth fear something then  eventually a devil representing that  fear will manifest in hell an easy  example is how humans fear of darkness  led to the creation of the darkness  devil the angel devil is the same in  that he was born out of humanity's fear  of angels and if we consider for a  second just how terrifying biblically  accurate angels are then yeah it makes  sense why a lot of people would be  afraid anyway while it's true that the  underworld is a completely separate  dimension there are still ways for  devils to escape with the most common  method being reincarnation what this  means is that if the devil is killed in  hell then following its death it gets  reincarnated somewhere on the planet  where it now has the chance to eat as  many people as it wants to as a result  most countries employ devil hunters to  help protect their population and this  is what brings us to angel's tragic  backstory originally when the angel  devil first reincarnated on earth he was  born in a tropical island with no memory  of his past life and it didn't take long  for him to blend in with the local  village unlike most devils he never had  the urge to kill anyone since it was  confirmed in chapter 34 that devils who  look human tend to be more friendly  towards people that's why in this  tropical paradise he was able to make  friends with the villagers who taught  him how to speak their language and  built him his own house eventually he  also got into a relationship with one of  the local women and it seemed like he  had a peaceful existence where most of  his days were spent either swimming or  relaxing on the beach however this all  began to change when makima arrived and  for those who don't know makima is a  high-ranking devil hunter that works for  the japanese government her motivation  for attracting him to this remote  village is revealed later in the series  where it's explained that during his  previous life in hell angel was a loyal  disciple of the chainsaw devil for  making his own reason she'd been  searching for the chainsaw devil for a  long time and along the way she hunted  down seven of his disciples with angel  now being the eighth following a brief  introduction she uses her abilities to  force him to demonstrate his power and  while under her control the angel devil  massacres the entire village including  his girlfriend impressed by his raw  talent machima then erases his memory  and brings him to tokyo where he's made  to work as a devil hunter alongside  other former disciples of chainsaw man  before we go any further though it's  probably best that we explain what his  amazing power is since makame even said  that his potential makes him the  strongest agent they have to put it  simply the angel devil has three unique  abilities the first of which is that he  drains the life force of any human he  touches by making even the smallest  contact with someone he instantly  decreases their lifespan and if that  contact is maintained for too long the  person he's touching will eventually die  this is the method that was used to wipe  out his home village when makima was  controlling him and on a separate  occasion aki's lifespan was reduced by  two months after the two of them briefly  touched hands a quirk like this makes  angel one of the most dangerous  characters to be around but in a similar  way to rogue from the x-men movies he  hates his own powers and usually avoids  touching people unless he has to now  moving on to his second ability the  angel devil can create supernatural  weapons that are made from the life  force of his victims as an example when  he drained his girlfriend he likely  stole at least 40 to 50 years from her  lifespan and then later on when he was  ready he used 10 of those years to  produce this magical sword here we can  see that a halo is used to generate  these new weapons and their supernatural  power varies depending on how many years  were needed to manifest it in chapter 35  a katana that angel made was used to  kill a devil that should have been  impossible to cut through and in chapter  60 he used five years of life to create  a sword that slices people without  leaving a scratch these are both clear  demonstrations of his insane potential  but there's a good reason why he  generally doesn't like producing these  weapons when angel was first introduced  he had at least 1 120 years worth of  life that he'd absorbed from other  people and he later confessed how these  victims would sometimes haunt him in his  nightmares because of this he often  hesitates to use their life force to  create these weapons and on one occasion  he even apologized for using their  lifespans in this way  finally angel's last unique power is  that he has bulletproof wings that can  block gunfire from close range but as of  making this video there hasn't been any  confirmation that the wings also allow  him to fly  anyhow with that said it's time to  explore the remaining personality traits  that make him such an intriguing  character and to do this we need to  flash back to the first few volumes of  the manga in those early volumes it was  plain to see that to be a devil hunter  you need to have a specific reason for  taking the job whether that reason be  revenge family commitments or something  more ridiculous  even devils like power had a goal that  they wanted to accomplish but when it  came to angel he genuinely had no  purpose from his perspective nothing  about being a devil hunter made life  worth living and this lack of motivation  led to him constantly slacking around  and at one point admitting that he'd  rather die to continue working his  outspoken nature and sluggish demeanor  made for a pretty entertaining combo but  as an audience we sympathize with angel  because not only was he the unhappiest  devil but he's also the most human  despite the fact that he's supposed to  be a bloodthirsty creature angel  demonstrates human emotions like empathy  when he tells a dying woman she's going  to heaven he demonstrates regret  regarding the lies he's had to take and  of course he demonstrated love and when  you combine all of those things together  you get a unique devil who's closer to  being human than certain human  characters in the series  now before we end the video i'm gonna do  some quick fire trivia but fair warning  there will be spoilers from this point  forward  okay so point number one is that the  angel devil likely had a completely  different appearance during his first  life as it's been proven that devils  take on a new form when they get  reincarnated this opens up the  possibility that in hell angel did  actually look like a biblically accurate  angel but it's also possible that he  still look like a human with alternate  features  point number two is that in the latest  popularity poll japanese readers ranked  angel as the seventh most popular  character with his devil hunting partner  aki being ranked in first place point  number three is that the first time  makame puts him under her control she  comes out of nowhere and approaches him  on the beach but the second time he goes  under her control the reverse happens  with him being the one to approach her  on the beach point number four is that  for some unusual reason angel's arms  didn't regenerate after being cut up by  the darkness devil but in chapter 89 we  see that both of his arms have now  returned likely thanks to makima's  influence point number five is that most  of the former disciples of chainsaw man  remembered one thing from their time in  hell which is the sound of his chainsaw  engine before they died the only  exception to this is the shark fiend who  seems to have a clear memory of what the  chainsaw devil was like and he even  explains to denji how exactly chainsaw  used to use his powers this implies that  the shark devil might not have actually  died and been reincarnated like everyone  else but instead maybe he was captured  in hell and then somehow brought to  earth by makima  lastly the final bit of trivia is about  the town mouse and the country mouse  this tale is one of esol's famous short  stories anthony chainsaw man several  characters gave their perspective on  which mouse they'd rather be the way the  story goes is that the town mouse gets  to live in a big house in the city and  eat all the best food but has a high  risk of being killed by either cats or  humans by contrast the country mask gets  to live in relative safety in the  countryside but doesn't get to have the  luxuries that come with being a town  mouse in chainsaw man characters like  denji preferred being the town mouse  because he values having fun more than a  life of peace but in angel's case we  know that he belongs in the country and  the fact that makima brought into the  city is exactly why he's so depressed on  a personal level i lean more towards  being a country mouse as well however  let me know down below in the comments  which mask you'd rather be also don't  forget to subscribe if you enjoyed the  video and leave a like if you want to  see more chainsaw man content like this  thanks for watching as always and until  the next one peace out

